:'''???:''' I thought no one would notice me if I just waited at a corner of the Memory Zone...
:'''"Evernight":''' But I see that wasn't enough to fool you, my dear (Trailblazer).
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Who... are you?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've missed you so much, March 7th...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you steal my memories?
:'''"Evernight":''' Looks like you're no longer that surprised to see me, even though I am an uninvited guest.
:'''"Evernight":''' I wouldn't do that. Ever.
:'''"Evernight":''' Only you can see me right now. I only exist in your cognition, so that way, other people can't interrupt us.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We need to talk about what's going on with you...
::'''"Evernight":''' You mean, what's going on with "March 7th."
::'''"Evernight":''' Good. I like people who don't beat around the bush, so let's talk about the one thing you should know...
::Where is March 7th?
::'''"Evernight":''' She's... nowhere.
::'''"Evernight":''' It looks like you still aren't prepared for the worst, hmm.
::What exactly do you want?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where is March 7th?
::'''"Evernight":''' She's... nowhere.
::'''"Evernight":''' It looks like you still aren't prepared for the worst, hmm.
::What exactly do you want?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What exactly do you want?
:'''"Evernight":''' Time's ticking, (Trailblazer).
:'''"Evernight":''' Why don't you just listen to the one thing you should know instead of getting distracted by the details?
:'''"Evernight":''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Your friend "March 7th" is no more.}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No... more?
::'''"Evernight":''' Yep. No more.
::Explain yourself!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Explain yourself!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why should I believe you?
:'''"Evernight":''' Heh... It's just like what she predicted. The truth shook you, just like she said it would.
:'''"Evernight":''' "March 7th" entered this world long before you and Dan Heng arrived at Amphoreus.
:'''"Evernight":''' She embraced the Path of Remembrance to save you two and burned away, like a lone candle in the fog.
:'''"Evernight":''' And I... am the shadow cast by her candlelight.
:'''"Evernight":''' I've been hiding within the cracks of Time all these years. It isn't easy to deceive a genius, but I can do it.
:'''"Evernight":''' I'll now answer your other question about who returned the Coreflame of Time in this cycle.
:'''"Evernight":''' The answer is simple.
:'''"Evernight":''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|No one ever did.}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Coreflame of Time... was never returned?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I knew it... You overwrote everyone's memories.
:'''"Evernight":''' I believe someone as sharp as (Trailblazer) would definitely figure out that something's wrong.
:'''"Evernight":''' When the Era Nova fails to proceed, you will remember our initial meeting, and I'll be able to open the way for the Remembrance and reach this place.
:'''"Evernight":''' Thank you for carrying this Coreflame all the way to the end of the world. I expected nothing less from "March 7th's" trusted friend. And now...
:'''"Evernight":''' I shall claim the divine authority of Time.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You lied to everyone! Why!?
::'''"Evernight":''' There's not much in this universe that I care about, except "March 7th" and her cherished companions.
::What do you need the divine authority of Time for?
::I only care about March 7th's safety!
::'''"Evernight":''' I already told you. She no longer exists. But you still have a chance to fix everything.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What do you need the divine authority of Time for?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I only care about March 7th's safety!
::'''"Evernight":''' I already told you. She no longer exists. But you still have a chance to fix everything.
:'''"Evernight":''' The divine authority isn't actually all that important. What's important is that I will use it to participate in the inner workings of this world.
:'''"Evernight":''' You already have a good idea of what the Era Nova does, right? It initiates extrapolations for the next cycle based on the Worldbearer's "memories."
:'''"Evernight":''' This immutable experimental mechanism is the key to the geniuses' resistance against Irontomb. And now... I'll be lending it just a touch more help.
:'''"Evernight":''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Let me filter your memories, keep the appropriate seeds, and discard the rest. That way... We'll be able to complete an Era Nova that this world has never before seen.}}
:'''"Evernight":''' It won't take too long. You just need to step into the {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Rain of Sensation}} with me. I'll tell you who deserves to be forgotten... and who deserves to be remembered.
:'''"Evernight":''' With your "memories" as the base material, I will re-create the cause and effect of this world, and let a flawless "Amphoreus" be born from the chaos!
:'''"Evernight":''' Isn't the fate of the entire cosmos hinged upon this fight? Then this is the best way to ensure everything works out. It will most certainly defeat the Destruction while composing an unforgettable chapter for the Trailblaze.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No. I can't trust you.
::'''"Evernight":''' I'm not surprised at your answer. But I don't need your trust right now.
::And who would be forgotten?
::'''"Evernight":''' Mere mortals. Flawed individuals. Failed heroes... People like them cannot nurture the world and would only become "memory" impurities.
::But they still don't deserve to be forgotten.
::'''"Evernight":''' Yet "being forgotten" is the normal state of life. The universe is like a wasteland filled with rubbish, where occasional treasures lie undiscovered.
::'''"Evernight":''' Besides, that's what March 7th wanted.
::Your plan is no better than Lygus's.
::'''"Evernight":''' Of course. You've got to be at the same level as a genius if you want to contend with them.
::'''"Evernight":''' Besides, that's what March 7th wanted.
::Your plan is no better than Lygus's.
::'''"Evernight":''' Of course. You've got to be at the same level as a genius if you want to contend with them.
::'''"Evernight":''' Besides, that's what March 7th wanted.
::You're not March 7th! Give her back!
