:::'''"Evernight":''' Besides, that's what March 7th wanted.
:::Your plan is no better than Lygus's.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Your plan is no better than Lygus's.
::'''"Evernight":''' Of course. You've got to be at the same level as a genius if you want to contend with them.
::'''"Evernight":''' Besides, that's what March 7th wanted.
::Your plan is no better than Lygus's.
::'''"Evernight":''' Of course. You've got to be at the same level as a genius if you want to contend with them.
::'''"Evernight":''' Besides, that's what March 7th wanted.
::You're not March 7th! Give her back!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Your plan is no better than Lygus's.
::'''"Evernight":''' Of course. You've got to be at the same level as a genius if you want to contend with them.
::'''"Evernight":''' Besides, that's what March 7th wanted.
::You're not March 7th! Give her back!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're not March 7th! Give her back!
:'''"Evernight":''' You're right. I'm not "her," but our hearts are closely intertwined.
:'''"Evernight":''' Besides, that's what March 7th wanted.
:'''"Evernight":''' "If a new life is to be born, its seed has to be dead."
:'''"Evernight":''' "March 7th" made a wish to me before she disappeared. Her only wish... was for the Trailblaze's journey to continue without an end.
:'''"Evernight":''' I'll definitely fulfil that small wish for her.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're twisting her wish!
:'''Cyrene:''' "(Trailblazer), what's going on? Your consciousness... suddenly went so far away."
